     2	# ============================================================================
     3	# depth_canon_eval_run.sh -- exp_25 depth_canon: the evaluation campaign driver
     4	# (plan_depth_canon.md v9 §5 "Drivers:" + atomic cell completion), adapted from exp_17's
     5	# yaw_aug_a6000_extras_run.sh with its review findings applied (explicit protocol flags,
