./worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_15_yaw_aug_claude/yaw_aug_codex_plan_review.md:42:   **Fix:** Make YAWAUG@90 descriptive/mechanistic, never gating. Integrity gates should be limited to executable harness checks: VANL positive control with a numeric threshold, golden random assignment, full input/assignment hash integrity, protocol/checkpoint validation, and cell completeness. Treat historical-row reproduction as a non-halting external check with a predeclared formula, following exp_14 G5 (`plan_yaw_gen.md:71-75`).
./worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_15_yaw_aug_claude/yaw_aug_codex_plan_review.md:48:   More importantly, both arms have one training run. Five evaluation seeds estimate diffusion/rotation-assignment variability, not training-run variability. Matching training seed and step does not pair away checkpoint-band variability (`plan_yaw_aug.md:151`).
